      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "遺跡のひとつである異教徒の洞窟という場所に\n調査隊を派遣したのですが、\n連絡が途絶えてしまったのです。\nその安否を確認に行っていただけませんか？",
        "official_en": "I've dispatched an expedition to the ruins in\nHeretics' Cave. But I've lost contact with them\nand am beginning to worry. Could I ask you to\ncheck on their safety?",
        "real_en": "I've dispatched an expedition to the ruins in\nHeathens' Cave. But I've lost contact with them\nand am beginning to worry. Could I ask you to\ncheck on their safety?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
