      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "彼らは見つかりませんでしたか……\nなんらかの事故に巻き込まれたのでしょう。\n今回は経費の回収は諦めますか。\nまた資金を作り、挑むとしましょう。",
        "official_en": "So you couldn't find them, huh? They must have\ngotten caught up in some sort of accident. Well,\nI suppose we can revisit this ruin exploration later.\nWe'll need to raise more funds before we try again.",
